OL,3,GNEWSALand Rover driver dies in
OL,4,APerthshire crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died following a crash near
OL,7,FAuchterarder, in Perth and Kinross.
OL,9,FEmergency services were called at 14:20
OL,10,Fon Friday to the A824 Auchterarder to
OL,11,FAberuthven Road, near Damside.
OL,13,FThe 41-year-old, who was driving a Land
OL,14,FRover Freelander, was pronounced dead
OL,15,Fat the scene.
OL,17,FThe road was closed until 23:30 while
OL,18,Finvestigations were carried out.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
